%%{init: {'theme':'base','themeVariables':{'fontFamily':'serif','actorBkg':'#ffffff','actorBorder':'#000000','actorTextColor':'#000000','activationBkgColor':'#ffffff','activationBorderColor':'#000000','signalColor':'#000000','signalTextColor':'#000000','labelBoxBkgColor':'#ffffff','labelBoxBorderColor':'#000000','labelTextColor':'#000000','loopTextColor':'#000000','noteBkgColor':'#ffffff','noteBorderColor':'#000000','noteTextColor':'#000000','messageFontColor':'#000000'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant MC as MaterialsController
    participant MS as MaterialsService
    participant JS as JobsService
    participant CO as OcrCoordinator<br/>(in-API sweep, 15 s)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    B->>MC: POST /materials/upload
    MC->>MS: store file (local) → material UPLOADED
    B->>MC: POST /materials/:id/process
    MC->>JS: INSERT jobs (MATERIAL_PROCESS)
    Note over JS: Not published to RabbitMQ — OCR is coordinator-owned.
    JS-->>B: 202 {jobId}

    loop Coordinator sweep (15 s)
        CO->>DB: adopt queued MATERIAL_PROCESS jobs
        CO->>DB: material → PROCESSING, job → processing
        CO->>DB: materialize chunk 1 (pages 1..CHUNK_SIZE) → pending
    end